    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You manipulate another creature's blood to enhance their speed and ability to act.</p><p>Choose a blooded creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. Until the start of your next turn, the creature's <strong>Speed</strong> increases by <strong>+5</strong>, and it can take an extra <strong>Action</strong> on its turn.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> or <strong>1 source of fresh blood</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain this effect, choosing a new target if you wish</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.KoHQ6jmewhn0uGjy]{Blood Frenzy}</p>",
